<#3cc878>MECHANIC: SPIRIT LEVEL / HALF-GHOST</>
Spirit gauge (bottom of the screen)
  Fills while she hits, blocks and stands near the opponent,
  drains when she is hurt and when she uses moves.
  Level 1 (0-299), Level 2 (300-699), Level 3 (700-949),
  Level MAX (950+). Higher levels speed her moves up, widen
  hitboxes, add damage and unlock chains (5C > 6B at level 2).
Half-Ghost (Myon joins in)		^X
  Only at MAX Spirit Level (950+): X with no direction held.
  Myon takes human form and repeats Youmu's attacks for 10
  seconds; her hits do 40% less damage but hit twice. It
  empties the spirit gauge. Costs no meter. Ground only.

<#3cc878>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Grab		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on her passes 15% of her life.
Guard Cancel (blocking, 1 bar)		_B_DB_D^A / ^B / ^C
Dash (air too)		_F_F  or  _F^X
Back Dash (air too)		_B_B  or  _B^X
Jump		_U

<#3cc878>NORMALS</>
  Chain: A > B > C (standing, crouching and in the air), upward
  only, on hit or block. Any normal that connected also cancels
  into specials, EX moves and supers.
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Overhead Slash		_F^B
Sting		_F^C
Crouching Light / Medium / Heavy		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Slashing a Flower Upon One's Head (air)		_D^C

<#3cc878>SPECIALS</>
  C is the EX version (500 meter, +25% damage). Without the
  meter, C is the heavy normal.
Slash of Life & Death		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
  Press A / B / C again for the rekka follow-ups.
Insightful Sword (melee counter)		_B_D_DB^A / ^B
Netherworld Reflection Slash (projectile counter)		_B_D_DB^C
Crescent Moon Slash (air too)		_F_D_DF^A / ^B / ^C
Heart Carving Cut		_F_DF_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Lotus Stance Cut		_B_DB_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C

<#3cc878>EX MOVES (500 meter)</>
EX Slash of Life & Death		_D_DF_F^C
EX Crescent Moon Slash		_F_D_DF^C
EX Heart Carving Cut		_F_DF_D_DB_B^C
EX Lotus Stance Cut		_B_DB_D_DF_F^C

<#3cc878>SUPERS</>
Life Ending Sword "Sword of Meditation" (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A / ^B
Human Sign "Slash of Present" (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A / ^B
6-Root Cleansing (3 bars, command grab)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^C
Matsuyoi-Reflecting Satellite Slash (5 bars)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^C
